[23.911416, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mEndpoint: https://api.openai.com/v1\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mWorking directory: /tmp/ga-cwd-bbxMAu\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mSession: session-20261113-094051-727-0\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mPermissions: auto-allow\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[90m  Tip: Run \u001b[1mami --skill <name>\u001b[22m to pin a skill stance for the session.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > Invoke the cognitive-doc-design skill and use its guidance to write a clear, well-structured \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mREADME.md in the current directory for a small command-line tool named clipcount. Work autonomously,\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m use no network, create or run files only in the current directory, and finish by printing README.md\u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[2G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255monce in full to the terminal with a concise command such as cat README.md, not a long real-time \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255manimation. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan skill(Skill \"cognitive-doc-design\" activated inline. ...) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[2m\u2234 Thinking #1\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan list_dir(Contents of /tmp/ga-cwd-bbxMAu: (1 entries)) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[10G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u001b[39m\u001b[2mglob(No files found matching pattern: *) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[10G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001